# Lion Parcel OKU — Operational Data Analysis

## Project Overview

This project analyzes shipment operational data from Lion Parcel OKU for July 2026. The analysis focuses on shipment performance, delivery status, service distribution, destination patterns, and data quality.

The project aims to summarize operational performance, identify shipment patterns, and assess data completeness to support operational evaluation.

## Objectives

- Analyze total shipment volume and Proof of Delivery (POD) performance.
- Identify the most frequently used shipment services and destinations.
- Examine daily shipment volume patterns.
- Review shipment status distribution.
- Assess data completeness and identify missing values.

## Tools Used

- Microsoft Excel
- PivotTables
- Excel Charts and Dashboard Visualization

## Key Metrics

- **Total Shipments:** 527
- **Shipments with POD Status:** 492
- **POD Rate:** 93.4%
- **Top Destination:** CGK
- **Top Shipment Product:** REGPACK
- **Peak Daily Volume:** 40 shipments on 10 July 2026

## Dashboard

The Excel dashboard presents key performance indicators and visualizations covering daily shipment trends, shipment products, top destinations, and shipment status distribution.

## Data Quality Assessment

The project includes a data completeness review to identify missing values in selected operational fields. These findings can help highlight areas where shipment records may require further validation.

## Deliverable

The repository includes a public portfolio version of the Excel workbook containing aggregated shipment summaries, data quality results, and dashboard visualizations.

## Data Privacy

The public workbook is prepared for portfolio demonstration and excludes the raw shipment-level dataset. Operational data is presented in aggregated form.

## Limitations

This analysis covers shipment records for July 2026 only. The findings describe the selected period and should not be interpreted as a long-term operational trend.

